# Local/sensitive runtime state — never commit.
# ncm_session.json = the login cookie (MUSIC_U) for the user's account;
# music_cache/     = downloaded audio + the song metadata beside it;
# playback.json    = pid of the current ffplay child (.tmp = its atomic-write
#                    scratch file, left behind only by a crash mid-write);
# playback.lock    = persistent inode used for the OS-owned process lock;
# login_qr.png     = a live login QR (scannable = usable), deleted on success;
# ncm_mcp.log      = server log.
ncm_session.json
music_cache/
playback.json
.playback.json.*.tmp
playback.lock
login_qr.png
ncm_mcp.log
